$MDESC::Type = "CTF Mixed";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> NecroBones Argentis VI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Author: <f0> Ed T. Toton III, aka [ADP]Bones" @
         "\n<f1>Website: <f0> http://www.necrobones.com/" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face each other for control of the desert planet, from high above the surface. The victor will be determined by who can capture the flag the most, without falling to their deaths from this immense altitude. There are no available vehicles, but due to this planet's slightly reduced gravity, it is possible to make the flight to the enemy ship if properly equipped.";
